---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us | Institute of Property">
  <div class="py-16 px-6 sm:px-12 bg-background min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto prose prose-slate">
      <h1>About the Institute of Property</h1>
      <p>We believe property investment education should be rooted in mathematics, legal realities, and long-term risk management, not hype.</p>

      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>To provide analytical, clear, and objective data to help UK investors make profitable decisions. We are tired of the "get rich quick" seminars that gloss over void periods, Section 24, and hidden maintenance costs.</p>

      <h2>The Analytical Approach</h2>
      <p>Every tool and guide on this site is built around stress-testing scenarios. If a deal doesn't work on paper after accounting for realistic operational costs, it won't work in real life.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
